{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-03-02 12:41:00', 'title': 'NUCLEAR REGULATORY COMMISSION APPROVES PG&E REQUEST RELATED TO CONTINUED OPERATIONS AT DIABLO CANYON POWER PLANT (DCPP)', 'text': "NRC DECISION SUPPORTS STATE LEGISLATION TO SEEK EXTENDED OPERATIONS AT DCPP AVILA BEACH, CALIF. , MARCH 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ON MARCH 2, 2023 THE NUCLEAR REGULATORY COMMISSION (NRC) APPROVED PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY'S (PG&E) EXEMPTION REQUEST TO ALLOW CONTINUED OPERATIONS AT DIABLO CANYON POWER PLANT (DCPP) PAST THE PLANT'S CURRENT LICENSES."}